  "intro": "\n\n<p class=\"lead\">Find your bra size in under a minute. Take two quick measurements, enter them in inches or centimeters, and get your size, your sister sizes and the Veloura bras in stock for you. <a href=\"#calculator\">Already measured? Jump to the calculator ↓</a></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:24px\">How to Measure Your Bra Size at Home</h2>\n<p>You need a soft measuring tape, a mirror and a non-padded (or lightly padded) bra. Stand straight and breathe normally.</p>\n<div class=\"steps\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <span class=\"num\">STEP 1</span>\n    <svg class=\"sjb-ill\" viewbox=\"0 0 280 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrated woman measuring her underbust with a tape wrapped snugly just below the bust\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs><clippath id=\"sjbclip1\"><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"112\"></circle></clippath></defs><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"112\" fill=\"var(--brand-soft)\"></circle><g clip-path=\"url(#sjbclip1)\">\n<ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"34\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></ellipse>\n<rect x=\"131\" y=\"78\" width=\"18\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e3ad88\"></rect>\n<path d=\"M140 250 L86 250 Q90 180 88 140 Q86 118 92 108 Q112 98 140 98 Q168 98 188 108 Q194 118 192 140 Q190 180 194 250 Z\" fill=\"#eab894\"></path>\n<path d=\"M94 110 Q78 118 76 140 Q74 156 104 166\" stroke=\"#e3ad88\" stroke-width=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M186 110 Q202 118 204 140 Q206 156 176 166\" stroke=\"#e3ad88\" stroke-width=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M118 103 L121 130 M162 103 L159 130\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M104 145 Q106 126 122 128 Q136 130 140 146 Z\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></path>\n<path d=\"M176 145 Q174 126 158 128 Q144 130 140 146 Z\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></path>\n<rect x=\"103\" y=\"145\" width=\"74\" height=\"7\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#7a2f54\"></rect>\n<rect x=\"82\" y=\"160\" width=\"116\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#f6c445\" stroke=\"#d9a521\"></rect>\n<line x1=\"84\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"108\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"108\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"116\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"124\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"124\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"148\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"164\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"172\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"172\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"188\" y1=\"161\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>\n</g><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"166\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e3ad88\"></circle><circle cx=\"176\" cy=\"166\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e3ad88\"></circle>\n<ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"26\" fill=\"#eab894\"></ellipse>\n<path d=\"M117 55 Q118 30 140 30 Q163 30 163 55 Q156 41 140 39 Q124 41 117 55 Z\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></path>\n<circle cx=\"131\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></circle><circle cx=\"149\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></circle>\n<path d=\"M134 70 Q140 74 146 70\" stroke=\"#a5543e\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M200 166 H218 V140\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M200 166 l7 -4 v8 z\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></path>\n<rect x=\"172\" y=\"118\" width=\"92\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></rect>\n<text x=\"218\" y=\"133\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">UNDERBUST</text>\n</svg>\n    <h3>Measure your underbust (band)</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Wrap the tape around your ribcage, right under your bust.</li>\n      <li>Keep it snug, flat and level all the way round.</li>\n      <li>Round to the nearest whole number. If it's even, add 4. If it's odd, add 5. That's your band size (28 → 32, 27 → 32).</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <span class=\"num\">STEP 2</span>\n    <svg class=\"sjb-ill\" viewbox=\"0 0 280 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrated woman measuring her bust with a tape around the fullest part of the bust\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs><clippath id=\"sjbclip2\"><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"112\"></circle></clippath></defs><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"132\" r=\"112\" fill=\"var(--brand-soft)\"></circle><g clip-path=\"url(#sjbclip2)\">\n<ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"34\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></ellipse>\n<rect x=\"131\" y=\"78\" width=\"18\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e3ad88\"></rect>\n<path d=\"M140 250 L86 250 Q90 180 88 140 Q86 118 92 108 Q112 98 140 98 Q168 98 188 108 Q194 118 192 140 Q190 180 194 250 Z\" fill=\"#eab894\"></path>\n<path d=\"M94 110 Q78 118 76 140 Q74 130 104 140\" stroke=\"#e3ad88\" stroke-width=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M186 110 Q202 118 204 140 Q206 130 176 140\" stroke=\"#e3ad88\" stroke-width=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M118 103 L121 130 M162 103 L159 130\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M104 145 Q106 126 122 128 Q136 130 140 146 Z\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></path>\n<path d=\"M176 145 Q174 126 158 128 Q144 130 140 146 Z\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></path>\n<rect x=\"103\" y=\"145\" width=\"74\" height=\"7\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#7a2f54\"></rect>\n<rect x=\"82\" y=\"134\" width=\"116\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#f6c445\" stroke=\"#d9a521\"></rect>\n<line x1=\"84\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"92\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"108\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"108\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"116\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"124\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"124\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"148\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"164\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"172\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"172\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><line x1=\"188\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"139\" stroke=\"#a87b10\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line>\n</g><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"140\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e3ad88\"></circle><circle cx=\"176\" cy=\"140\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e3ad88\"></circle>\n<ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"58\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"26\" fill=\"#eab894\"></ellipse>\n<path d=\"M117 55 Q118 30 140 30 Q163 30 163 55 Q156 41 140 39 Q124 41 117 55 Z\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></path>\n<circle cx=\"131\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></circle><circle cx=\"149\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#3b2626\"></circle>\n<path d=\"M134 70 Q140 74 146 70\" stroke=\"#a5543e\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n<path d=\"M200 140 H218 V114\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M200 140 l7 -4 v8 z\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></path>\n<rect x=\"160\" y=\"92\" width=\"116\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"></rect>\n<text x=\"218\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">FULLEST BUST</text>\n</svg>\n    <h3>Measure your bust (cup)</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Wrap the tape around the fullest part of your bust.</li>\n      <li>Keep it snug but not tight, and don't squash the bust.</li>\n      <li>Round to the nearest whole number and subtract your band size: 1 inch = A, 2 = B, 3 = C, 4 = D and so on.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><strong>Example:</strong> underbust 28″ is even, so the band is 28 + 4 = 32. With a bust of 35″, 35 − 32 = 3″, which is a C cup. Your size is <strong>32C</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"calculator\">Calculate Your Bra Size</h2>\n",
  "outro": "<h2>Bra Cup Size Chart</h2>\n<p>Bust (rounded to the nearest inch) minus band size (1 inch ≈ 2.5 cm):</p>\n<div class=\"scroll\">\n<table>\n  <thead><tr>\n<th>Difference (inches)</th>\n<th>Difference (cm)</th>\n<th>Cup size</th>\n</tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n<td>0 or less</td>\n<td>0 or less</td>\n<td>AA</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2.5</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>B</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>7.5</td>\n<td>C</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>D</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>12.5</td>\n<td>DD</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>DDD</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>17.5</td>\n<td>G</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>H</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>22.5</td>\n<td>I</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<td>10 or more</td>\n<td>25 or more</td>\n<td>J</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<h2>What Are Sister Sizes?</h2>\n<p>Sister sizes have the same cup volume on a different band. If your size is out of stock or the band feels too loose or tight, try one band down and one cup up (34B → 32C), or one band up and one cup down (34B → 36A). The calculator shows both for you.</p>\n\n<h2>Do's &amp; Don'ts for Accurate Measurements</h2>\n<div class=\"dd\">\n  <div class=\"card do\">\n    <h3>✔ Do</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Wear a non-padded or lightly padded bra.</li>\n      <li>Breathe normally and stand straight.</li>\n      <li>Keep the tape flat and level on your back.</li>\n      <li>Measure again if you're near your period. Your bust can be slightly fuller then.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card dont\">\n    <h3>✘ Don't</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Measure over a heavily padded or push-up bra.</li>\n      <li>Pull the tape so tight that it digs into your skin.</li>\n      <li>Hold your breath or suck in your stomach.</li>\n      <li>Rely on an old size. Re-measure every 6–12 months, or after weight change or pregnancy.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Bra Size FAQs</h2>\n<details><summary>How do I know if my bra fits correctly?</summary><p>The band sits level and snug on the loosest hook, the cups hold your bust without gaps or spilling, the centre panel lies flat on your chest, and the straps don't dig in.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can I measure my bra size without a measuring tape?</summary><p>Yes. Wrap a string or charger cable around your body the same way, mark it, then lay it against a ruler or scale and enter that number.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What if I'm between two sizes?</summary><p>Try the sister size first. If the band feels loose, go one band down and one cup up. If it feels tight, go one band up and one cup down.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Does bra size change over time?</summary><p>Yes. Weight changes, hormones, pregnancy, breastfeeding and age can all change it, so re-measure every 6–12 months.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can I measure in centimeters?</summary><p>Yes. Switch the calculator to Centimeters and enter your measurements. It converts them for you.</p></details>\n\n<div class=\"cta\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:0\">Found Your Size? Shop Your Perfect Fit</h2>\n  <p>Padded, non-padded, push-up, seamless and sports bras, delivered across Pakistan.</p>\n  <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/collections/bras-in-pakistan\">Shop Bras</a>\n  <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/collections/bra-panty-sets\" style=\"width:auto;margin-top:6px\">Shop Bra Panty Sets</a>\n</div>\n\n"
